{"id":"7eb380164954dfb8","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-godel-system.md","title":"Gödel System","display":"df-godel-system — Gödel System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-godel-system","aliases":["90-df-godel-system"],"display":"df-godel-system — Gödel System","depends_on":["[[90-df-godel-system-definition]]","[[90-df-representation]]","[[90-df-strong-representation]]","[[90-df-consistency-statement]]","[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[88-df-ce-set]]","[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","[[90-df-godel-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-godel-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-godel-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-godel-system — Gödel System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9f8586e4baa616ce\" href=\"?note=9f8586e4baa616ce\" title=\"90-df-godel-system-definition\">90-df-godel-system-definition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"635265d0fe56f718\" href=\"?note=635265d0fe56f718\" title=\"90-df-representation\">90-df-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cc78339b84b14c7b\" href=\"?note=cc78339b84b14c7b\" title=\"90-df-strong-representation\">90-df-strong-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4e89323a1592aeb9\" href=\"?note=4e89323a1592aeb9\" title=\"90-df-consistency-statement\">90-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b7d7a03ff76428de\" href=\"?note=b7d7a03ff76428de\" title=\"90-df-robinson-arithmetic\">90-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"002c574215686062\" href=\"?note=002c574215686062\" title=\"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory\">90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G=(S,\\operatorname{Ax}_G,g,d,\\mathrm{Sub}_S,\\operatorname{ProofCode}_G)\">\\(\\mathcal G=(S,\\operatorname{Ax}_G,g,d,\\mathrm{Sub}_S,\\operatorname{ProofCode}_G)\\)</span> (presentation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"9f8586e4baa616ce\" href=\"?note=9f8586e4baa616ce\" title=\"90-df-godel-system-definition\">90-df-godel-system-definition</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=\\operatorname{Ax}_G\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(G=\\operatorname{Ax}_G\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>，其定理由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a> 的可证关系给出</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}\">\\(\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}\\)</span> (effective-axiomatizability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"002c574215686062\" href=\"?note=002c574215686062\" title=\"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory\">90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\)</span> (effective Gödel-numbering predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(G)\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(G)\\)</span> (metatheoretic consistency, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"4e89323a1592aeb9\" href=\"?note=4e89323a1592aeb9\" title=\"90-df-consistency-statement\">90-df-consistency-statement</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> (Robinson arithmetic, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"b7d7a03ff76428de\" href=\"?note=b7d7a03ff76428de\" title=\"90-df-robinson-arithmetic\">90-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GodelSys}\">\\(\\mathrm{GodelSys}\\)</span> (Gödel-system predicate, defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Represents}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Represents}_G\\)</span> (relation-representability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"635265d0fe56f718\" href=\"?note=635265d0fe56f718\" title=\"90-df-representation\">90-df-representation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongRep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongRep}_G\\)</span> (strong function-representability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"cc78339b84b14c7b\" href=\"?note=cc78339b84b14c7b\" title=\"90-df-strong-representation\">90-df-strong-representation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}_2,\\mathrm{PRPred}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}_2,\\mathrm{PRPred}_2\\)</span> (binary primitive-recursive functions and predicates, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}system}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GodelSys}(\\mathcal G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(G)\\land\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\land\n\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(G)\\land\n\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq G\\land\n\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2\\land\n\\operatorname{ProofCode}_G\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_2\\land\n\\exists\\vartheta_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S[v_0,v_1,v_2]\\;\\exists\\pi_G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S[v_0,v_1]\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{StrongRep}_G(\\mathrm{Sub}_S,\\vartheta_{\\mathrm{Sub}})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Represents}_G(\\operatorname{ProofCode}_G,\\pi_G)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}system}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GodelSys}(\\mathcal G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(G)\\land\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\land\n\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(G)\\land\n\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq G\\land\n\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2\\land\n\\operatorname{ProofCode}_G\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_2\\land\n\\exists\\vartheta_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S[v_0,v_1,v_2]\\;\\exists\\pi_G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S[v_0,v_1]\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{StrongRep}_G(\\mathrm{Sub}_S,\\vartheta_{\\mathrm{Sub}})\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Represents}_G(\\operatorname{ProofCode}_G,\\pi_G)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>公理的句法对象先经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 编码后再谈 c.e.；不能把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}_G\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}_G\\)</span> 直接作为自然数集合传给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\)</span> 由三元公式强表示，二元关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProofCode}_G\">\\(\\operatorname{ProofCode}_G\\)</span> 则直接逐数表示；二者不再被错误压成同一个一元表示性调用。</li>\n<li>哥德尔系统是哥德尔第一不完备性定理适用的系统类别</li>\n<li>哥德尔系统&quot;足够强&quot;以至于不完备</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>核心特征</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>有能力进行算术编码</li>\n<li>有能力表示自身的语法</li>\n<li>有能力进行自指论证</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>例子</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Peano 算术 PA 具有这种呈现；Robinson 算术 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 提供所需的最低算术基底。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>性质</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>第一不完备性：一致哥德尔系统不完备</li>\n<li>第二不完备性还要求证明谓词满足相应可导条件。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>相关概念</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-21\" data-note=\"31a1cb59fb59977d\" href=\"?note=31a1cb59fb59977d\" title=\"90-df-representability-theorem\">90-df-representability-theorem</a> — 哥德尔系统的核心定理</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-22\" data-note=\"b2b5974a0bdc4e1b\" href=\"?note=b2b5974a0bdc4e1b\" title=\"90-df-godel-sentence\">90-df-godel-sentence</a> — 哥德尔系统中构造的自指句</li>\n</ul>\n<p>元组的代入函数及证明码关系受 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-23\" data-note=\"9f8586e4baa616ce\" href=\"?note=9f8586e4baa616ce\" title=\"90-df-godel-system-definition\">90-df-godel-system-definition</a> 的组件相容条件约束。这里对代入函数的内部统一存在唯一性要求仍予保留；没有用较弱的逐数图表示取代 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongRep}\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongRep}\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-godel-system-definition","status":"resolved","id":"9f8586e4baa616ce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","locati